### Create multiple widgets for testing

### Create Widget 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Basic Widget",
  "description": "A simple widget for basic tasks",
  "image": "basic-widget.jpg"
}

### Create Widget 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Advanced Widget",
  "description": "A more advanced widget with additional features",
  "image": "advanced-widget.jpg"
}

### Create Widget 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Premium Widget",
  "description": "Our top-of-the-line widget with all features",
  "image": "premium-widget.jpg"
}

### Get all widgets to verify creation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets

### Search widgets by partial name match (should return Basic Widget)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byName?name=Basic

### Search widgets by partial name match (should return Advanced Widget)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byName?name=Advanced

### Search widgets by partial name match (should return all widgets with "Widget" in the name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byName?name=Widget

### Search widgets by partial description match (should return widgets with "features" in the description)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byDescription?description=features

### Search widgets by partial description match (should return widgets with "widget" in the description)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byDescription?description=widget

### Update Widget 1 (replace 1 with actual ID after creation)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Basic Widget 2.0",
  "description": "An improved version of our basic widget",
  "image": "basic-widget-2.jpg"
}

### Get updated widget to verify changes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/1

### Search for updated widget by new name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/search/byName?name=2.0